{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0dob3N0JTIwTW91bnRhaW5lZXIlMjAlMjgyMDE1JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Ghost Mountaineer","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zDiRk9bkaxJCH06h4Bg1byW9AaI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lRwbQf5nVyp3ABL8dM739GQgLFa.jpg","description":"An Estonian student hiking group get caught up in a series of scary events unfolding in wintry Siberia. The unpopular group leader Olle, becomes disappointed in his companions during the trip and disappears on the last day in the mountains. His rival, liberal-minded and adventurous Eero guides the descending hikers into a Buryate village on the mountain to seek help. A weird and insane chain of events is unleashed which seems to be orchestrated by the missing Olle. In a foreign land and among people they do not know, the hikers are faced with a task which they at first do not want to undertake and later are unable to tackle.\n\nReleased 27 Nov 2015 · Estonia, Italy · 90 min\nStudio: Kopli Kinokompanii, Decima Rosa Video\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Mystery","Adventure","Thriller","Horror","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.0","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Priit Pius","Reimo Sagor","Hanna Martinson","Liis Remmel","Veiko Porkanen","Rait Õunapuu","Vadim Andreyev","Valerii Sanzheev"],"director":["Urmas E. Liiv"],"released":"2015-11-27T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"A frozen land, an ancient legend, death awaits.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Urmas E. Liiv","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s9w3LULoeViOGEwtuv0bm4gWTge.jpg"},{"name":"Priit Pius","character":"Eero","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zlUXQTqRi2PpLct72l08fFVoLBc.jpg"},{"name":"Reimo Sagor","character":"Olle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o2bzB7MAwutoRfecRZkaOsjt6jo.jpg"},{"name":"Hanna Martinson","character":"Marleen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mNZAccnADoKFfPCsejnnZ3emk1A.jpg